<h4>PATHWAY OF HOPE</h4>
<div><strong>Breaking the Cycle of Crisis Through Long-Term Support</strong></div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>Meeting your family's immediate needs is important. Building a brighter future is transformational. Pathway of Hope helps families with children overcome barriers, set achievable goals, and work toward lasting stability.</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div><strong>What Is Pathway of Hope?</strong></div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>Pathway of Hope is a Salvation Army initiative designed to help families with children move beyond crisis and achieve long-term stability. Through personalized case management and goal-focused support, families are empowered to address challenges related to income, employment, education, housing, and overall well-being. Our approach focuses on identifying strengths, building resilience, and creating a customized pathway toward lasting change.</div>
</div>
			<div class="py-5"></div>
			<div class="my-2"></div>
			<div class="row my-3">
				<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12 d-flex flex-column">
					<div class="rounded p-6 gap-3 mt-3 bg-light text-dark card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill bg-area" style="color:#111111;font-weight:700">
<h6>How Pathway of Hope Works</h6>
<p><strong>Assessment</strong></p>
<ul style="list-style-type: disc;">
<li>Meet with a dedicated case manager to discuss your family's goals and challenges.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Goal Planning</strong></p>
<ul style="list-style-type: disc;">
<li>Create a personalized action plan focused on long-term stability.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Support &amp; Resources</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Connect with services and community resources that support your journey.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Progress Tracking</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Celebrate milestones and adjust goals as you move forward.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Lasting Stability</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Build confidence, independence, and a stronger future for your family.</li>
</ul>
</div>
				</div>
				<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12 d-flex flex-column">
					<div class="rounded p-6 gap-3 mt-3 bg-light text-dark card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill bg-area" style="color:#111111;font-weight:700">
<h6>Support Along the Way</h6>
<p><strong>Employment Assistance</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Job readiness, workforce development, and employment resources.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Financial Stability</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Budgeting support, financial education, and goal planning.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Education</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Connection to educational opportunities and training programs.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Housing Resources</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Access to housing-related support and community partnerships.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Family Development</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Strengthening family support systems and overall well-being.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Community Connections</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Referrals to local resources and supportive services.</li>
</ul>
</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="py-5"></div>
			<div class="rounded p-6 gap-3 mt-3 bg-light text-dark" style="color:#111111">
<section>
<h6>Who Is Eligible?</h6>
<p>Pathway of Hope is designed for families with children who are ready to work toward achieving long-term goals and increased self-sufficiency.</p>
<ul>
<li>Families with dependent children</li>
<li>Individuals motivated to set and pursue goals</li>
<li>Families facing challenges related to housing, employment, education, or financial stability</li>
<li>Residents seeking long-term support beyond emergency assistance</li>
</ul>
</section>
</div>
<div class="rounded p-6 gap-3 mt-3 bg-light text-dark" style="color: #111111;">
<section>
<h6>Available Throughout Florida</h6>
<p>Pathway of Hope is offered through participating Salvation Army locations across Florida. Families can connect with the nearest location to learn more about eligibility and available services.</p>
</section>
